  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1217:b001:l001": "Subject is the lacquered lance in preceding1216:b001:l042; sentence continues across the batch boundary.",
    "manas-2010:p1217:b001:l019": "Chestnut stallion belongs contextually to the struck Chinese rider, not a renaming of Almambet’s Sarala; off preserves the unhorsing at20.",
    "manas-2010:p1217:b001:l022": "Him is contextually Zhanybay, whose herders try to remount him before Syrgak strikes his neck.",
    "manas-2010:p1217:b001:l041": "Forty-one retains the leader plus the forty herders; neither count normalized away.",
    "manas-2010:p1218:b001:l006": "Кара көк human epithet resolute/fearless, Yudakhin көкIII https://el-sozduk.kg/көк/. Not a horse-color description here.",
    "manas-2010:p1218:b001:l007": "Implicit subject of7–11 returns to attacking Karagul, despite Syrgak being named on6; no unprinted actor added.",
    "manas-2010:p1218:b001:l020": "Visible inability to turn the horse’s head retained beside the ensuing successful turn; no negative deleted.",
    "manas-2010:p1218:b001:l026": "Saddle-pommel and heart target remain distinct rows of the spoken thrusting formula; no unprinted body part substituted.",
    "manas-2010:p1219:b001:l009": "Ит балдак is a swimming stroke, literally dog-paddle: 1969 Kyrgyz explanatory dictionary https://el-sozduk.kg/baldak/ and Yudakhin https://eurasica.ru/dict/?l=i&w=519. Not a somersault. River context confirms swimming.",
    "manas-2010:p1219:b001:l025": "Almost touching the sky is the herd-driving hyperbole; no dust-only paraphrase replaces the horses.",
    "manas-2010:p1219:b001:l032": "Visible dying/alive wording retained with contextual division into dying and still-living animals left on the road; precise construction remains compressed.",
    "manas-2010:p1220:b001:l003": "Kürpüldök’s Sary-Suu retained as the source’s waterway designation; no modern map identification asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p1220:b001:l008": "Муун/муунак translated turns/knotted stretches of the route; exact terrain segmentation remains qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1220:b001:l022": "Visible токтолуп halting retained before the rush into water; no silent added negative.",
    "manas-2010:p1220:b001:l024": "Kambar Ata’s black stallion retains the source’s named horse-patron association; not an independently verified pedigree.",
    "manas-2010:p1220:b001:l029": "Bracelet markings interpreted as the horse’s leg markings, without assuming metal jewelry or a specific marking pattern.",
    "manas-2010:p1220:b001:l037": "Көйкашка outstanding/excellent: Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/КӨЙ/. Here it distinguishes the horses that cross successfully.",
    "manas-2010:p1221:b001:l014": "Exactly twelve days retained as stated; no chronological recalculation from earlier travel.",
    "manas-2010:p1221:b001:l017": "Capitalized Калча is Kongurbay’s Fierce One epithet, edition1838:b001:l030–031; not an added second person.",
    "manas-2010:p1221:b001:l025": "Visible эки, two, retained in the awkward two-Chinese/forty-khans construction; not silently changed to эли, people.",
    "manas-2010:p1221:b001:l028": "Mother’s death continues27; Almambet remains alive. English makes this contextual referent explicit without adding resurrection.",
    "manas-2010:p1221:b001:l036": "Кара көк resolute human epithet as at1218:6, not black-blue skin.",
    "manas-2010:p1221:b001:l041": "Кечил rendered shaven-headed ones in this collective enemy designation; no assertion that every soldier was an ordained monk.",
    "manas-2010:p1222:b001:l013": "Lion on guard is retained literally as the epic’s supernatural animal sentry; no human guard substituted.",
    "manas-2010:p1223:b001:l004": "Түмөн rendered ten thousand in this troop-number context, with no claim of a verified historical muster.",
    "manas-2010:p1223:b001:l009": "Chongküröng retained as Ezkara’s named mount; distinct from the packhorse Kartküröng.",
    "manas-2010:p1223:b001:l015": "Ылама rendered lama, the printed religious title; precise relation between this title and Zholoy on16 remains appositional.",
    "manas-2010:p1223:b001:l027": "Unmarked speech shift interpreted as Almambet addressing Syrgak, identified in28; not Karykan addressing an enemy companion.",
    "manas-2010:p1223:b001:l029": "Twelve Beijings retains the epic geographical multiplicity, not twelve modern municipalities.",
    "manas-2010:p1223:b001:l030": "Perish with your horses is an angry exclamation, retained even though it is addressed to the beloved companion on31.",
    "manas-2010:p1224:b001:l010": "Сында жок provisionally not put to this test in the overwhelming-army context; the precise idiomatic force of сын remains uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p1224:b001:l014": "Visible коо ravine and the double-negative sense retained: no ravine that an enemy cannot circle. No silent replacement with a heroic name.",
    "manas-2010:p1224:b001:l029": "Коок camel-hide head covering, exact edition glossary1839:b001:l022. The verse threatens captive punishment; no unprinted procedure added.",
    "manas-2010:p1224:b001:l036": "Ritual ablution understood from даарат and pure afterlife destination at42; both hand and foot repetitions preserved.",
    "manas-2010:p1225:b001:l008": "Visible беш кол five hands retained, despite unusual angel anatomy; not silently reduced to one hand or changed to five fingers.",
    "manas-2010:p1225:b001:l015": "Sun/night rhetorical question retained as printed, including the negative күн тийбестен; exact assertion remains paradoxical.",
    "manas-2010:p1225:b001:l030": "Келеме жака exact Yudakhin collar embroidered with metallic braid https://el-sozduk.kg/келеме/. The ordinary broad-collar guess is not used.",
    "manas-2010:p1225:b001:l031": "Суп чепкен in epic is a costly white-cloth coat, white silk or white camel wool: exact Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/суп/. Fine white coat preserves the epic sense without forcing ordinary cotton sense1 or a unique fiber. Traditional craft dictionary https://tamgasoft.kg/dict/index.php?lang=en&lfrom=kg&lto=kg&word=чепкен also describes the camel-wool variety.",
    "manas-2010:p1225:b001:l033": "Printed куп, splendid, kept distinct from суп at31; no source normalization.",
    "manas-2010:p1225:b001:l038": "Biting the garment while sewing is the stated labor image; not a separate attack or impossible human armor test.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l001": "Талдырган provisionally worked/laid down the silk; exact textile-processing operation is not established.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l004": "Handspan retained as the garment layer’s epic thickness; not converted to a modern armor specification.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l010": "Алмаз болот adamant steel describes the two warriors; not emended to өлбөс, immortal.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l015": "Same fine white coat designation as1225:31; material is not automatically cotton.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l019": "Rib armor followed by shoulder-blades is the printed arrangement; body locations not silently harmonized.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l021": "Себил protective equipment, context armor; no specific modern material or chemical composition supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1226:b001:l041": "Implicit speaker is Almambet calling Syrgak, explicit at1227:1; not Kongurbay issuing friendly instructions.",
    "manas-2010:p1227:b001:l004": "Adyrmak provisionally a named stopping point, repeated at9; hilly terrain sense remains possible and no modern location is claimed.",
    "manas-2010:p1227:b001:l017": "Seven-day limit retained after the six-day warning at5; apparent escalation not normalized.",
    "manas-2010:p1227:b001:l026": "Gray vastness/mountain comparison retained as warning against underestimating Kongurbay, not treated as an identified mountain.",
    "manas-2010:p1228:b001:l002": "Мал ачуу interpreted as the bitterness of livestock loss motivating pursuit, rather than bitter-tasting livestock.",
    "manas-2010:p1228:b001:l010": "Algara’s wings are explicit epic anatomy; not reduced to a mere speed adjective.",
    "manas-2010:p1228:b001:l024": "Evil-spirit seizure of the wife is the simile for frantic rage, not a reported offstage event.",
    "manas-2010:p1228:b001:l029": "Мөндү preserved as the named enemy battle-cry Möndü, within a fully translated reporting clause. No unsupported lexical translation or identified deity supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1228:b001:l042": "Visible күндөй like the sun retained beside thunder; not silently changed to cloud or thunderstorm.",
    "manas-2010:p1229:b001:l003": "Калдай governor, established edition glossary/project lexicon; not generic giant.",
    "manas-2010:p1229:b001:l019": "Ribs creaking is the battle exertion image; no unprinted fracture inserted before the later blows.",
    "manas-2010:p1230:b001:l021": "Firmly entering describes the lance thrust; penetration depth and organ injury are not invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1230:b001:l025": "Ыйык жал horse withers, not holy mountain/ridge; unseating into the mane area is the action.",
    "manas-2010:p1230:b001:l031": "Lance noun remains on31 and the single swing condition on32, preserving the row boundary.",
    "manas-2010:p1230:b001:l037": "Subject of37–42 is contextually Sarala, identified at1231:4, not Kongurbay who has not traveled from Talas.",
    "manas-2010:p1231:b001:l013": "Доолбас war-drum retained as a separately stated action before whipping the horse.",
    "manas-2010:p1231:b001:l015": "Көк эт provisionally flank muscle in the horse-whipping context; exact anatomical location is qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1231:b001:l030": "Seeing one’s life is the near-death/pain idiom; not literal disembodiment.",
    "manas-2010:p1232:b001:l002": "Black cliff beneath him retained as the printed image. Horse metaphor is possible beside carries on3; an actual precipice is explicit later1233:25–33. Exact syntax remains unresolved at the image level, not silently harmonized.",
    "manas-2010:p1232:b001:l015": "Аадан = наадан, foolish, consistent with initial-n loss documented in edition preface15.",
    "manas-2010:p1232:b001:l017": "Making Syrgak a donkey and riding him is the explicit threat; no automatic deletion as inconsistent with affection.",
    "manas-2010:p1232:b001:l030": "Visible деңиз sea/ocean retained in the unusual ocean-vast life image; not silently changed to a standard dear-life formula.",
    "manas-2010:p1232:b001:l036": "Black felt hat’s brim is the recurrent metaphor for Syrgak; no added Karakalpak ethnic identity here.",
    "manas-2010:p1233:b001:l004": "Эки түгөй provisionally two paired ribs. Whether two ribs or two pairs is intended remains uncertain; count wording not normalized.",
    "manas-2010:p1233:b001:l018": "Two eyes becoming four is the eager-vigilance idiom; number image retained, not anatomical transformation.",
    "manas-2010:p1233:b001:l022": "Visible no wind striking the face retained despite the galloping context; no added wind supplied to explain fainting.",
    "manas-2010:p1233:b001:l040": "Dead/deadened life revived follows bodily rescue; no independent assertion of literal resurrection.",
    "manas-2010:p1234:b001:l007": "Both horse and fugitive are within the possessive phrase; plural heads makes that contextual scope explicit.",
    "manas-2010:p1234:b001:l016": "Comparison with Manas provisionally Syrgak matching him at lancing, except Manas’s sacred might at14; no general superiority claim.",
    "manas-2010:p1235:b001:l001": "Black crescent and golden banner are the visible colors/ornament; no modern flag identification.",
    "manas-2010:p1235:b001:l006": "Mangkush retained as the capitalized giant’s name; no modern identity supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1235:b001:l014": "Dark faith is the narrative’s religious disparagement, not the translator’s characterization of living communities.",
    "manas-2010:p1235:b001:l029": "Алакелеп invokes affectionate Алаке, Almambet; contextual imagined child mourning/calling him. Exact nuance remains qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1235:b001:l038": "Жүктөгөнүм бир болду retained as my burden has been one; the following childlessness supports a sorrow referent, but the compressed clause is not silently replaced with marriage or children.",
    "manas-2010:p1235:b001:l042": "Unbleeding heels and unspread hair retained as the source’s images of not giving birth; no modern medical inference.",
    "manas-2010:p1236:b001:l007": "Folding the corpse at the waist for loading is explicit; no invented burial posture beyond the transport instruction.",
    "manas-2010:p1236:b001:l013": "Slaughter of Sarala is the requested funeral sacrifice, not an action already completed.",
    "manas-2010:p1236:b001:l022": "Perish with your horses repeated, now by Syrgak; earlier Almambet’s identical exclamation retained at1223:30.",
    "manas-2010:p1236:b001:l036": "Seven days now belongs to Syrgak’s own proposed absence, echoing Almambet’s earlier instruction.",
    "manas-2010:p1236:b001:l042": "Туйгун prized pale goshawk, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/туйгун/. Final subject phrase continues into1237; no action supplied to end the sentence."
  },
